SUMMARY:Bloomington Stationery Club Meet-up
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a cozy fall Stationery Club meet-up on November 1
 9th at the Monroe County Public Library Downtown branch! Come hang out wi
 th fellow stationery fans and bring your favorite items to share or work 
 on. Junk journals\, letter writing\, planners\, etc!&#160\;  We will be m
 eeting in room 1C from 5-6:45 pm and light refreshments will be provided.
  Also\, don't forget to bring stationery items to swap and share with oth
 ers!&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join us for a cozy fall Stationery Club
  meet-up on November 19th at the Monroe County Public Library Downtown br
 anch! Come hang out with fellow stationery fans and bring your favorite i
 tems to share or work on. Junk journals\, letter writing\, planners\, etc
 !&#160\;</p><p>  We will be meeting in room 1C from 5-6:45 pm and light r
 efreshments will be provided. Also\, don't forget to bring stationery ite
 ms to swap and share with others!&#160\;</p>
