 oad\, scholarships\, and potential funding opportunities.Graduate Open Ho
 use:6:00-6:30 PM  Explore the new MA/MS of International and Regional Stu
 dies with a Latin American &amp\; Caribbean track\, and the CLACS PhD Min
 or and Certificate\, interdisciplinary research opportunities\, and resou
 rces for graduate students.All are welcome! Bring your questions\, meet o
 ur team\, and discover how Latin American and Caribbean Studies can devel
 op your academic and professional goals.
