SUMMARY:First Thursday Tour for Families: Art Investigators
DESCRIPTION:Discover art on the first and second floors of the museum\, s
 panning from ancient civilizations to modern art and enjoy activities alo
 ng the way. Collaborate to interpret works of art through music\, sketchi
 ng\, imagination\, poetry\, conversations\, and/or arts-based wellness ex
 periences.  The activities are designed for grade 2 and up but all ages a
 re welcome. Strollers are welcome\, too.&#160\;  RSVP for the total numbe
 r of people in your group\, including anyone in strollers\, so that we ca
 n plan for space.&#160\;&#160\;  &#160\;Know Before You GoWalk-ins are we
 lcome if there's space. To reserve a space\, RSVP below.Plan to arrive at
  least 5 minutes before your tour to check in and get ready.A small handb
 ag may be carried at your side. Larger bags and backpacks must be stored 
 before touring. Free lockers are available.Where to find us\, where to pa
 rk\, accessibility\, and museum guidelinesWhen You ArriveCheck in with Gu
 est Services staff on the first floor.Photography is welcome\, without fl
 ash or selfie stick.Please do not touch artwork.
