 >.</span></li></ul><h3><strong>About Your Facilitator</strong></h3><p>  D
 edaimia Whitney earned an MFA in fiction from Indiana University under th
 e direction of Scott Russell Sanders. She taught creative writing at Fran
 klin College for many years. She has served the museum as a docent since 
 2019. Her favorite works of art are those that are both visually stimulat
 ing and thought-provoking.</p>
