SUMMARY:Contemporary Dance Performance
DESCRIPTION:Before the dance performance  Tour the exhibition The Photogr
 aphic Reflex: The Lee Marks and John C. DePrez Jr. Collection with the cu
 rator at 11:30 before the IU Contemporary Dance performance inspired by t
 his exhibition\, at noon.&#160\;  Before the dance performance\, join Ben
  Levy\, Glaubinger Curator of Works on Paper\, for a guided short tour at
  11:30 am to learn more about some of the photographs that inspired the d
 ance performance. Details. (https://events.iu.edu/artmuseum/event/2395982
 -curator-led-tour)  About the dance performance  IU Contemporary Dance st
 udents have selected artworks in the exhibition as inspiration for an int
 erpretative dance performance at noon. They will perform original choreog
 raphy\, inspired by the exhibition.Read more about this exhibition. (http
 s://artmuseum.indiana.edu/exhibitions/2026-08-29-photographic-reflex-mark
 s-deprez.html)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<h3>  Before the dance performance</h3><p>  
 Tour the exhibition The Photographic Reflex: The Lee Marks and John C. De
 Prez Jr. Collection with the curator at 11:30 before the IU Contemporary 
 Dance performance inspired by this exhibition\, at noon.&#160\;</p><p>  B
 efore the dance performance\, join Ben Levy\, Glaubinger Curator of Works
  on Paper\, for a guided short tour at 11:30 am to learn more about some 
 of the photographs that inspired the dance performance. <a href="https://
 events.iu.edu/artmuseum/event/2395982-curator-led-tour">Details.</a></p><
 h3>  About the dance performance</h3><p>  IU Contemporary Dance students 
 have selected artworks in the exhibition as inspiration for an interpreta
 tive dance performance at noon. They will perform original choreography\,
  inspired by the exhibition.</p><p><a href="https://artmuseum.indiana.edu
 /exhibitions/2026-08-29-photographic-reflex-marks-deprez.html">Read more 
 about this exhibition.</a></p>
