 aduate Student <span class="outlook-search-highlight" data-markjs="true">
 Roundtable</span> and Reception. We'll gather in Maxwell Hall\, seminar r
 oom 122\, for <span class="outlook-search-highlight" data-markjs="true">g
 raduate student</span> research presentations\, followed by a lively Q&am
 p\;A session. Afterwards\, enjoy a social event in the Maxwell Hall Grand
  Hall.</p>
