SUMMARY:HLS D.C. Global Policy Program: Launch Your Summer 2027 Career in
  Washington\, D.C.
DESCRIPTION:Looking to gain high-impact policy experience and expand your
  professional network in Washington\, D.C.? Drop by to learn more about t
 he Hamilton Lugar School D.C. Global Policy Program (https://hls.indiana.
 edu/careers/dc-global-policy-program/index.html) for Summer 2027.This in-
 person informational session provides an overview of the program's struct
 ure\, academic tracks\, and application timeline. Attendees will discover
  how the program connects students to hands-on experiences\, professional
  mentorship\, and career pathways in the nation's capital.Session Highlig
 hts &amp\; Important Dates:Program Term: Summer 2027 (runs approximately 
 May 27 – July 17\, 2027).Priority Application Deadline: Monday\, Februa
 ry 15\, 2027.Who Should Attend: Motivated undergraduates and graduate stu
 dents interested in foreign policy\, international affairs\, public servi
 ce\, and D.C. career opportunities.Q&amp\;A Session: Learn about housing\
 , program expectations\, and course integration options directly from pro
 gram staff.
